  "Title": "AKU Special Lecture: Bapsi Sidhwa on 'Where is Home?'",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "World renowned Pakistani author, Bapsi Sidhwa (seated centre), signing autographs for medical and nursing students at Aga Khan University on April 18, 2001.",
