  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass4F53684D42664F599E59229871B88D02\"><div>World renowned Pakistani author, Bapsi Sidhwa (seated centre), signing autographs for medical and nursing students at Aga Khan University on April 18, 2001. Ms. Sidhwa had come to AKU to share her experiences on 'Where is Home?' as part of Aga Khan University's Special Lecture Series (SLS).<br></div></div>",
